  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 15 + 5 × 8 – 72 ÷ 4 + 16 × 3 = 101\n\nOption 1) 5 and 4\n\nAfter two numbers (not digits) interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 15 + 4 × 8 – __**72 ÷ 5**__ + 16 × 3 = 101\n\n⇒ 15 + __**4 × 8**__ – 14.4 + __**16 × 3**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**15 + 32**__ – 14.4 __**+ 48**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**95 – 14.4**__ = 101\n\n⇒ 80.6 = 101\n\nOption 2) 15 and 16\n\nAfter two numbers (not digits) interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 16 + 5 × 8 – __**72 ÷ 4**__ + 15 × 3 = 101\n\n⇒ 16 + __**5 × 8**__ – 18 + __**15 × 3**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**16 + 40**__ – 18 __**+ 45**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**10**____**1__ – 18** = 101\n\n⇒ 83 = 101\n\n**Option 3) 5 and 3**\n\nAfter two numbers (not digits) interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 15 + 3 × 8 – __**72 ÷ 4**__ + 16 × 5 = 101\n\n⇒ 15 + __**3 × 8**__ – 18 + __**16 × 5**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**15 + 24**__ – 18 __**+ 80**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**119 – 18**__ = 101\n\n**⇒ 101 = 101**\n\nOption 4) 8 and 4\n\nAfter two numbers (not digits) interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 15 + 5 × 4 – __**72 ÷ 8**__ + 16 × 3 = 101\n\n⇒ 15 + __**5 × 4**__ – 9 + __**16 × 3**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**15 + 20**__ – 9 __**+ 48**__ = 101\n\n⇒ __**83 – 9**__ = 101\n\n⇒ 74 = 101\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"5 and 3\".",
